 in DER format.
 .TP
+\fB--refresh-import-auth\fR
+Update the password for a nonempty pending import request. All pending request
+bytes remain unchanged, including unrecognized signature lists. A failed
+firmware write requires retry; pending membership does not confirm authentication.
+.TP
 \fB--revoke-import\fR
 Revoke the current import request (MokNew)
 .TP
